      "id": "WEB-FOLLOWUP-STOP-1",
      "severity": "high",
      "status": "CONFIRMED_BUG_ON_B016DC3",
      "trigger": "当前回合运行时发送followup；首回合完成、自动followup正在运行时点击停止",
      "cause": "Gateway lastTurnBySession仅在直接session.send更新；自动followup使用新turnId，cancel仍引用旧id，actor返回not_running。",
      "rawEvidence": [
        "queued-stop-reproducer/result.json",
        "queued-stop-reproducer/snapshot-before-stop.json",
        "queued-stop-reproducer/snapshot-after-stop.json",
        "queued-stop-reproducer/after-stop.png",
        "queued-stop-reproducer/integration-red-cleanup-corrected.log"
      ],
      "minimalFix": "Gateway.handleCancel在绑定sender session上通过session.status读取activeTurn.turnId，再调用既有session.cancel；starting窗口保留lastTurn回退。Core/权限/沙箱不改。"
    }
